value.SKY_TWILIGHT_BELT.0=Off
value.SKY_TWILIGHT_BELT.1=On
option.SKY_VENUS=Evening star
option.SKY_VENUS.comment=At dusk or dawn, Venus lights up near the sun before any star and outshines them all.
value.SKY_VENUS.0=Off
value.SKY_VENUS.1=On
option.SKY_COMET=Comet
option.SKY_COMET.comment=Once in a while, for a few nights in a row, a comet hangs among the stars, with its dust tail and its bluish gas tail.
value.SKY_COMET.0=Off
value.SKY_COMET.1=On
option.SKY_ZODIACAL=Zodiacal light
