option.LUNAR_EVENTS_STRENGTH.comment=How strongly the colour of a lunar event tints the night.
option.FLOATING_LEAVES=Floating leaves
option.FLOATING_LEAVES.comment=Under trees, a few fallen leaves float on calm water, drift slowly with the wind, then sink. Many more in autumn.
value.FLOATING_LEAVES.0=Off
value.FLOATING_LEAVES.1=On
